# The Gemini API key is now stored on the server side (Firebase Functions),
# not packaged in the APK. No client-side key is needed.
#
# To deploy your own proxy function:
#   1. Create a Firebase project
#   2. Set the environment variable:
#        firebase functions:config set gemini.key="your_gemini_api_key_here"
#   3. Deploy:
#        firebase deploy --only functions
#   4. Update the PROXY_URL in GeminiTutorService.kt with your deployed function URL
#
# The Firebase Function handles the API key securely — it never reaches the client.
